{"contract":"bw-jmdict-shard/3","entries":[{"accent":2,"common":true,"etymology":[],"examples":[{"en":"He received a tremendous punch on the jaw from his opponent.","ja":"彼は相手からあごに強烈なパンチを受けた。","ref":"300847_102847","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He got a broken jaw and lost some teeth.","ja":"彼は顎の骨を折って、歯も何本か折れた。","ref":"294880_108809","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He sat at the table with his chin cupped in one hand.","ja":"彼はあごを片手にもたせて食卓にひじを突いて座っていた。","ref":"288699_114972","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He tucked the napkin under his chin.","ja":"彼はあごの下にナプキンをはさみ込んだ。","ref":"288697_114974","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"I hit him on the chin.","ja":"彼のあごを殴ってやった。","ref":"285224_118439","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["顎","頤","腭","腮","顋","齶"],"glosses":["jaw","chin","barb (of a fishhook)"],"id":"1207560","lemma":"顎","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"アゴ","readings":["あご","アゴ"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/顎#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/顎/顎/顎.html","https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/齶#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/齶/齶/齶.html"],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["顎骨","下巴","倒鉤","機器的鉗口","嘴唇以下的面部"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["顎骨"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["下巴"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["倒鉤"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["機器的鉗口"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["嘴唇以下的面部"],"pos":"char"}]},{"accent":1,"common":false,"forms":["斎垣","忌垣","齋垣"],"glosses":["fence around a shrine (or other sacred area)"],"id":"1295420","lemma":"斎垣","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"イガキ","readings":["いがき","いかき"]},{"accent":1,"common":true,"examples":[{"en":"He doesn't see his family in his busy life.","ja":"彼は忙しい生活の中で家族と会うことがない。","ref":"303697_100000","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He is a busy man, so you can only get in touch with him by telephone.","ja":"彼は忙しい人だから、電話でなければ連絡をとれないですよ。","ref":"303696_100001","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"In as much as he is busy, he can't meet you.","ja":"彼は忙しいので